# Line endings.
#
# This repo drifted to a 10-CRLF / 28-LF split, which also leaked into build
# output: dist/cli.js shipped with 190 CRLF and 850 LF lines in 2.0.1. Harmless
# for JS — and the shebang happened to land on LF, so the CLI still executed on
# Linux — but it made every diff noisy and left the next shebang to luck.
#
# Store text as LF in the repo and check it out as LF everywhere. This is a
# Node CLI targeting macOS/Linux; there is no Windows-tooling reason to keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.bin   binary
*.tgz   binary
*.ico   binary

# Generated / vendored — keep diffs collapsed in review.
package-lock.json               linguist-generated=true
docs/openapi-snapshot-*.json    linguist-generated=true
